Glass icon SVGs in this directory are derived from the
"Liquid Glass Icons" pack by Icons8, licensed under the MIT License
(see LICENSE in this directory).

Source: https://github.com/icons8/liquid-glass-icons

Modifications made when vendoring:
  - Converted from .tsx to .jsx (TypeScript types stripped).
  - Replaced gradient `stopColor: "#fff"` with `stopColor: "currentColor"`
    so icons can be tinted via CSS `color`.

Re-vendoring is handled by scripts/vendor-glass-icons.mjs.
